      "sourceURLs": [
        "https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold3/blob/v3.0.4/docs/installation.md",
        "https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold3/blob/v3.0.4/docs/performance.md",
        "https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold3/blob/v3.0.4/fetch_databases.sh"
      ],
      "notes": "The protein UI still requires all official v3.0.4 database paths here: the unmodified official CLI resolves RNA database paths when constructing DataPipelineConfig even for protein-only inputs. Do not substitute empty placeholders. The registry checks explicit assets; runtime semantic validation remains the installed engine responsibility."
